  "text": "The imaginary currency features a woven sun at its center, symbolizing shared work and collective effort. Encircling the sun is a vibrant violet border, denoting unity and resilience. On the reverse, nine square windows reveal intricate depictions of the city’s districts—each a unique district with its own identity and function. These windows represent transparency, opportunity, and the interconnectedness of urban life. The woven sun, crafted with threads of gold and silver, reflects light in a way that changes with the angle, reinforcing the idea of collaborative creation. Together, the a woven sun, nine square windows, and violet border form a powerful emblem of community, vision, and shared progress."
}

